      "why": "invented words (smart-manager's synthetic set): the stretch common to the five lines, once capitalised, spelled as four lines of five spell it; « Potion » and « Bouclier » are held by lines of other keys, and by only one line of the term" },
    { "id": "term_evidence/of/a-rival-with-two-lines-against-three", "op": "of",
