      "out": { "verdict": "thin", "word": null, "keys": [], "rivals": [] },
      "why": "the agreement, said as a limit: « ouvert » and « ouverte » are two writings at word edges, so no stretch is held by both lines" },
    { "id": "term_evidence/of/one-character-words-with-no-spaces", "op": "of",
      "in": { "term": "Sun", "lines": [
          {"key": "Sun Gate", "line": {"v": "陽門", "t": "V"}},
